## What changes
- **Format 2 is the only format.**
- **Dependencies:**
  - `{ shipment, version }` ranges;
  - runtimes are ordinary Shipments;
  - caret on 0.x excludes the next minor;
  - `{ url, sha256 }` and M0170/M0171 are removed.
